\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Fight the good fight With all thy might;\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Christ is thy strength, and Christ thy  right;
\par Lay hold on life, and it shall be
\par  Thy joy and crown eternally.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Run the straight race  Through God's good grace,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Lift up thine eyes, and seek His face;
\par Life with its path before us lies;
\par Christ is the way, and Christ the prize.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.   Cast care aside; Lean on thy Guide,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 His boundless mercy will provide, \tab 
\par Lean, and thy trusting soul shall prove
\par Christ is thy life, and Christ thy love
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Faint not, nor fear; His arm is near;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He changeth not, and thou art dear;
\par Only believe, and thou shalt see
\par \pard     That Christ is all in all to thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

